{"title":"Terry's Haunted Menagerie Halloween Karaoke Party","startsAt":"2026-10-30T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T01:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"🎃 Get into Halloween weekend with Nite 2 of **Terry’s Haunted Menagerie** — an evil travelling exhibit ranging from fuzzy to feathered to just plain bare bones.\nTerrorizing audiences with moaners & groaners 🎤 gathering to **cry, croon and howl into the night.** 🐺🦇\nCostumes encouraged — and if you need inspiration, think **ANIMALS**. 🐾\nMore details coming soon…\n\nCostumes are encouraged.\nAnimal theme optional\nPrizes for creatures of distiction\n\n**This isn’t a paid event, but it is an event for the venue’s paying customers — so please purchase something from the Hell Hole and support the establishment housing these creatures.** 👹","venue":{"name":"Scruffy Murphy's","address":"225 The East Mall, Etobicoke, ON M9B 6J6, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.6324,"lng":-79.552247,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Karaoke Meetup Group","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/2/9/b/highres_536284763.jpeg"}